<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{ title }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Same palette as the audit report (v1.3) */
      --header-blue:    #E97132;
      --footer-navy:    #0E2841;
      --row-stripe:     #fdf4ef;
      --row-divider:    #f0dccf;
      --text-primary:   #0E2841;
      --text-secondary: #5a6b78;
      --text-muted:     #8a98a3;

      /* Transformation kinds — borrowed from severity palette but remapped */
      --mechanical:    #1f8a4c;       /* green — high confidence */
      --mechanical-bg: #e1f5ea;
      --mechanical-br: #7cc197;

      --heuristic:    #f08c1a;       /* orange — needs review */
      --heuristic-bg: #fff1dc;
      --heuristic-br: #f3b463;

      --architectural:    #1f6dd6;   /* blue — alternative choice possible */
      --architectural-bg: #e3eefb;
      --architectural-br: #87aee6;

      --review-flag: #d8253b;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
                   "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      background: #ffffff;
      margin: 0; padding: 32px 40px; line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .container { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; }

    h1.report-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .report-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 24px 0; }

    .meta-row {
      display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 32px; padding-bottom: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
    }
    .meta-row strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }

    h2.section-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 36px 0 4px 0; }
    .section-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 18px 0; }

    /* Summary table */
    table.summary {
      width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0;
      border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15,58,82,0.08);
    }
    table.summary thead th {
      background: var(--header-blue); color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600; text-align: left;
      padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    table.summary thead th.num-col { text-align: center; }
    table.summary tbody td {
      padding: 14px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
      font-size: 14px; vertical-align: middle;
    }
    table.summary tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--row-stripe); }
    table.summary tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    table.summary .num-cell { text-align: center; }

    /* Kind pills */
    .pill {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-width: 28px; height: 26px; padding: 0 12px;
      border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;
      border: 1.5px solid transparent; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .pill.kind-mechanical    { background: var(--mechanical-bg);    color: var(--mechanical);    border-color: var(--mechanical-br); }
    .pill.kind-heuristic     { background: var(--heuristic-bg);     color: var(--heuristic);     border-color: var(--heuristic-br); }
    .pill.kind-architectural { background: var(--architectural-bg); color: var(--architectural); border-color: var(--architectural-br); }

    /* Totals strip — solid pills on navy */
    tfoot.totals tr td {
      background: var(--footer-navy); color: #fff;
      padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    tfoot.totals .total-pill {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-width: 44px; height: 30px; padding: 0 14px;
      border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: #fff;
    }
    .total-mechanical    { background: var(--mechanical); }
    .total-heuristic     { background: var(--heuristic); }
    .total-architectural { background: var(--architectural); }

    /* Layer banner */
    .layer-banner {
      margin-top: 20px; padding: 14px 18px;
      background: var(--row-stripe);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--header-blue);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .layer-banner strong { font-family: monospace; color: var(--header-blue); }

    /* Review flag callout */
    .review-callout {
      margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #fef4f6;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--review-flag);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .review-callout strong { color: var(--review-flag); }

    /* Transformation cards */
    .transformation {
      border: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--text-muted);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 14px 0;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .transformation.mechanical    { border-left-color: var(--mechanical); }
    .transformation.heuristic     { border-left-color: var(--heuristic); }
    .transformation.architectural { border-left-color: var(--architectural); }

    .transformation-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .transformation-rule {
      font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, Monaco, monospace;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      background: #eef2f5; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .confidence-tag {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .confidence-tag.low { color: var(--review-flag); font-weight: 600; }

    /* Before/after diff */
    .diff {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .diff-side {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, Monaco, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
      background: #f5f8fa;
    }
    .diff-side.before { border-left: 3px solid var(--review-flag); }
    .diff-side.after  { border-left: 3px solid var(--mechanical); }
    .diff-label {
      display: block; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .reasoning {
      font-size: 13px; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .reasoning strong { color: var(--text-primary); }

    .review-flag {
      margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px 14px;
      background: #fef4f6;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    footer.page-footer {
      margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;
    }
    /* Jasmine Conseil charter (v1.4.2) */
    body { font-family: Calibri, "Segoe UI", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; }
    .jc-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      margin: -32px -40px 28px -40px; padding: 18px 40px 14px 40px;
      border-top: 8px solid #E97132;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fdf0e8 0%, #ffffff 70%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-divider);
    }
    .jc-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .rv-logo { flex: none; display: block; }
    .rv-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E2841; line-height: 1.1; }
    .rv-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: .3px; }
    .jc-tag { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
    .api-card { border: 1px solid var(--row-divider); border-left: 4px solid #E97132; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 22px; background: #fffaf7; }
    .api-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .api-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E2841; }
    .api-pill { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #0E2841; color: #fff; }
    .api-pill.layer { background: #fdebe0; color: #b4531c; }
    .api-desc { margin: 10px 0 14px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; }
    .api-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 8px 24px; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
    .api-facts dt { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .api-facts dd { margin: 2px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; }
    table.api-ops { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    table.api-ops th { text-align: left; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; color: var(--text-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-divider); padding: 6px 8px; }
    table.api-ops td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-divider); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; }
    .api-verb { font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace; font-weight: 700; color: #E97132; }
    .rv-links a { color: #0E2841; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #E97132; }
    .jc-word { font-weight: 700; color: #E97132; font-size: 15px; }
    .jc-word span { color: #0E2841; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-left: 3px; }
    h1.report-title { color: #0E2841; }
    h2.section-title { color: #0E2841; border-left: 4px solid #E97132; padding-left: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <div class="jc-brand">
    <div class="jc-logo"><img class="rv-logo" width="44" height="44" alt="RAML Validator logo" src="data:image/png;base64,">
      <div><div class="rv-name">RAML Validator</div><div class="rv-sub">pour MuleSoft &middot; connectivité API-Led</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="jc-tag">{{ skill_version }} &middot; par <span class="jc-word">Jasmine<span>CONSEIL</span></span></div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="report-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  <p class="report-subtitle">Guide de remédiation personnalisé</p>

  <div class="meta-row">
    <span><strong>Source :</strong> {{ source_raml }}</span>
    <span><strong>Version corrigée :</strong> {{ refactored_raml }}</span>
    <span><strong>Généré le :</strong> {{ date }}</span>
    <span><strong>Skill :</strong> {{ skill_version }}</span>
  </div>

  {% if api %}
  <h2 class="section-title">API auditée</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Telle que déclarée dans la spécification{{ ' (description traduite)' if api.description_given }}.</p>
  <div class="api-card">
    <div class="api-head">
      <span class="api-title">{{ api.title }}</span>
      {% if api.version %}<span class="api-pill">{{ api.version }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="api-pill layer">{{ {'system':'System','process':'Process','experience':'Experience'}[api.layer] if api.layer != 'unknown' else 'Couche non déclarée' }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="api-desc">{{ api.description if api.description else 'Aucune description dans la spécification.' }}</p>
    <dl class="api-facts">
      <div><dt>Base URI</dt><dd>{{ api.base_uri or '—' }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Ressources</dt><dd>{{ api.resources }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Opérations</dt><dd>{{ api.operations }}{% if api.methods %} ({% for m, n in api.methods.items() %}{{ n }} {{ m }}{{ ', ' if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}){% endif %}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Sécurité</dt><dd>{{ api.security_schemes|join(', ') if api.security_schemes else 'aucune déclarée' }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <h2 class="section-title">Transformations appliquées</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">
    {{ transformations | length }} transformations réparties en 3 catégories.
    {% if starting_score is not none %}
    Audit initial : <strong>{{ starting_findings }} constats, score {{ starting_score }}/100</strong>.
    Score attendu après correction : <strong>100/100</strong>.
    {% endif %}
  </p>

  <table class="summary">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Type</th>
        <th>Description</th>
        <th class="num-col">Nombre</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="pill kind-mechanical">MÉCANIQUE</span></td>
        <td>Corrections déterministes et sûres (renommages, mise en forme, insertions structurelles).</td>
        <td class="num-cell">{{ by_kind.mechanical | length }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="pill kind-heuristic">HEURISTIQUE</span></td>
        <td>Valeurs par défaut adaptées au contexte, à relire (exemples provisoires, descriptions générées, URI par défaut).</td>
        <td class="num-cell">{{ by_kind.heuristic | length }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="pill kind-architectural">ARCHITECTURALE</span></td>
        <td>Choix structurants de couche ou de nommage, pour lesquels plusieurs réponses sont valables.</td>
        <td class="num-cell">{{ by_kind.architectural | length }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
    <tfoot class="totals">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2">Totaux</td>
        <td class="num-cell">
          <span class="total-pill total-mechanical">{{ by_kind.mechanical | length }}</span>
          <span class="total-pill total-heuristic">{{ by_kind.heuristic | length }}</span>
          <span class="total-pill total-architectural">{{ by_kind.architectural | length }}</span>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tfoot>
  </table>

  <div class="layer-banner">
    Couche API déduite : <strong>{{ inferred_layer }}-</strong> &mdash; {{ layer_reasoning }}
  </div>

  {% if needs_review %}
  <div class="review-callout">
    <strong>{{ needs_review | length }} transformation{{ 's' if needs_review|length != 1 else '' }}
    à relire</strong>
    (choix heuristiques ou architecturaux, ou résultats de confiance faible).
    Chacune est signalée ci-dessous.
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <h2 class="section-title">Transformations détaillées</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Dans l'ordre d'application. Chaque carte montre l'avant / après, la justification et les points à relire.</p>

  {% for t in transformations %}
  <div class="transformation {{ t.kind }}">
    <div class="transformation-head">
      <span class="pill kind-{{ t.kind }}">{{ kind_label[t.kind] | upper }}</span>
      <span class="transformation-rule">{{ t.rule }}</span>
      <span class="confidence-tag {% if t.confidence == 'low' %}low{% endif %}">
        confiance : {{ confidence_label[t.confidence] }}
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="diff">
      <div class="diff-side before">
        <span class="diff-label">Avant</span>{{ t.before }}
      </div>
      <div class="diff-side after">
        <span class="diff-label">Après</span>{{ t.after }}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reasoning"><strong>Justification :</strong> {{ t.reasoning }}</div>

    {% if t.kind == 'architectural' %}
    <div class="review-flag">
      🏛 <strong>Choix d'architecture.</strong> Cette transformation applique un
      choix raisonnable, mais d'autres sont valables. Vérifiez lequel convient à
      votre contexte.
    </div>
    {% elif t.kind == 'heuristic' or t.confidence == 'low' %}
    <div class="review-flag">
      🔍 <strong>À relire.</strong> La valeur appliquée est générique ;
      remplacez-la par un contenu métier avant la production.
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <h2 class="section-title">Prochaines étapes</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Relire le RAML corrigé</strong> ({{ refactored_raml }}).
        {% if needs_review %}En particulier les
        {{ needs_review | length }} transformation{{ 's' if needs_review|length != 1 else '' }}
        signalée{{ 's' if needs_review|length != 1 else '' }} ci-dessus.{% endif %}</li>
    <li><strong>Remplacer les valeurs provisoires.</strong> Les descriptions générées
        (DOC-001/002/003), les URI d'authentification (SEC-001) et les exemples
        (SPEC-001/002) respectent les règles mais n'ont aucun sens métier.</li>
    <li><strong>Vérifier les noms de scopes</strong> si SEC-002 a été appliquée :
        le générateur les déduit du chemin ; ils doivent exister dans votre
        fournisseur d'identité.</li>
    <li><strong>Refaire l'audit du RAML corrigé</strong> pour confirmer 100/100 GO.
        Tout autre résultat est un bug à signaler.</li>
    <li><strong>Enregistrer les deux fichiers ensemble</strong> — le RAML corrigé et
        ce guide, qui sert de journal des modifications.</li>
  </ol>

  <footer class="page-footer">
    <span>Généré par {{ skill_version }}</span>
    <span>{{ date }}</span>
    <span class="rv-links"><a href="https://github.com/karimdjaafar/mulesoft-raml-validator" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Projet</a> &middot; <a href="https://github.com/karimdjaafar/mulesoft-raml-validator/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPER-GUIDE.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Guide développeur</a> &middot; <a href="https://github.com/karimdjaafar/mulesoft-raml-validator/issues/new/choose" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Retours</a> &middot; Contact : <a href="mailto:kdjaafar@jasmineconseil.com?subject=RAML%20Validator" target="_blank" rel="noopener">kdjaafar@jasmineconseil.com</a></span>
    <span style="color:#E97132">&copy; 2026 Jasmine Conseil</span>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
